# Markdown policy: only the root README.md may be tracked on GitHub.
# Every other Markdown file (subfolder READMEs, local change/analysis notes) stays local and untracked.
*.md
!/README.md

# Local change/analysis notes under docs/changes/ — keep on disk for reference, never commit.
# (Already covered by *.md above; listed explicitly to document intent.)
docs/changes/*.md
